# Blog Automation — Space 4 Time Ltd
# Three posts per week, website only. No social media.
#
# Install (VPS):   crontab -u blogbot /opt/blog-automation/cron-schedule.crontab
# Check:           crontab -l
# Remove:          crontab -r
#
# Times are CET (Europe/Berlin). Monday / Wednesday / Friday at 09:00 —
# spread across the week so consecutive posts are never published back to back,
# and in the morning so a failure can be noticed and rerun the same day.

SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin

# Monday, Wednesday, Friday: write, translate and publish one article
0 9 * * 1,3,5 /opt/blog-automation/cron-schedule.sh publish

# Social media posting is intentionally not scheduled. To turn it back on,
# run the pipeline with --with-social (or set ENABLE_SOCIAL=true) and restore
# the staggered per-network lines from git history.
